item+ struct src/oauth.rs :: Editors :: pub struct Editors { :: Accounts allowed to use the editor once signed in.  The list starts from `PHEXT_EDITORS` (the operator's bootstrap list) and can grow at runtime: when an editor accepts a submission, the originator's account is admitted — appended here and, when a backing file is configured (see `Gate::load_editors_file`), to that file, so the admission takes effect immediately and survives restarts. Entries sit behind a lock because admission happens through `&Gate` while other requests are reading the list. :: doc comment :: 817 :: 1
