item+ enum src/coordinate_ext.rs :: Dimension :: pub enum Dimension { :: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Dimension enum for editor navigation. Maps 1-9 keys to the nine phext dimensions (scroll=innermost, library=outermost).  NOTE: this index counts from the scroll outward — it is a key/wire index, NOT the canonical dimension number. Canonical numbering follows the written address (Library.Shelf.Series / Collection.Volume.Book / Chapter.Section.Scroll): Library is dimension 1, Scroll is dimension 9 (Will's ruling, 2026-11-10). Teaching surfaces state the canonical number; this enum's values remain the key/wire convention, and renumbering them is a behavioral change, not a display change. -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- :: doc comment :: 34 :: 1
